{
  "readme": [
    "HEARTROT arena geometry. THIS FILE IS THE MAP. Redraw `grid` in a text editor,",
    "then run `python3 tools/gen_map.py` to recompile programs/heartrot/src/map.rs and",
    "packages/client/src/map.ts. Never hand-edit either of those two files.",
    "",
    "Layout, top to bottom -- the 33 Immortals composition of",
    "docs/architecture/11-immortals-spec.md 1.1:",
    "  y=0        border wall",
    "  y=1..23    OPEN FLOOR, the boss's air. It MUST be floor and not wall: `shoot`'s",
    "             raycast tests `is_wall` before the part rectangles, so one wall tile",
    "             between a player and the boss kills every shot in that column. The",
    "             pit ceiling is a movement rule (map::PIT_TOP), not a wall.",
    "  y=24..35   `P` pit floor, 12 rows, corner-shaped on rows 33/34/35 (2/4/7 tiles",
    "             in from each side) so it reads as an ellipse. 718 walkable tiles,",
    "             726 counting the doorway below it.",
    "  y=36..37   rim wall, open only at x=30..33 -- the doorway, also `P` so the band",
    "             reaches down to the gate. A player who flips zone standing on a gate",
    "             tile is one step below PIT_BOT, so their next step north is legal and",
    "             they are not boxed out of every move. Hence the destination test.",
    "  y=38..39   `G` gate tiles, the block `enter_gate` demands you stand in.",
    "  y=40..62   the lobby, a pillared temple approach.",
    "  y=63       border wall",
    "",
    "`B` at tile (32, 25) is the boss anchor: map::BOSS_SPAWN. The `E` marks are the",
    "four respawn doors and all four sit inside the pit.",
    "",
    "gen_map.py refuses to emit a map whose entrances cannot reach the heart, whose",
    "spawn points sit in a wall or outside the pit band, whose gate is not a solid",
    "rectangle sitting immediately below the pit, or whose pit is pinched in two by",
    "the corner shaping -- a raider clamped to the band cannot walk around it."
  ],
  "tile_size": 16,
  "legend": {
    "#": "wall (solid)",
    ".": "floor",
    "P": "floor, pit - the raider box; the P bounding rows emit PIT_TOP/PIT_BOT",
    "G": "floor, gate - the block enter_gate demands; emits GATE_MIN_X..GATE_MAX_Y",
    "E": "floor, entrance - a respawn door, must flood-fill to the heart",
    "B": "floor, heart of the chamber - the boss spawn tile"
  },
